# copy and paste a state: click to select, copy, paste -> a sibling with a
# fresh id and a +20 offset; then cut a state and paste it back. Gadget sits
# clear of the pasted Widget copy so the editor keeps it where it is placed
new-state G0 100 100 160 90 Widget
click 100 100
copy
paste
new-state G0 560 100 160 90 Gadget
click 560 100
cut
paste
